 "solution": "\\(\\dfrac{3+\\mathrm{i}}{\\mathrm{i}}=\\dfrac{(3+\\mathrm{i})(-\\mathrm{i})}{\\mathrm{i}\\cdot(-\\mathrm{i})}=\\dfrac{-3\\mathrm{i}+1}{1}=1-3\\mathrm{i}\\)。\n\\(|1-3\\mathrm{i}|=\\sqrt{1^2+(-3)^2}=\\sqrt{10}\\)。",
 "explanation": {
